{"id": "doc-01", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une équipe peut aligner au maximum **onze joueurs** sur le terrain [ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1] ; le même plafond de onze joueurs est confirmé dans l’introduction de la loi 3 du football [wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-8-du-football#balle-a-terre/2", "ifab-loi-03#7-personne-supplementaire-sur-le-terrain/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/5"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 976, "tokens_out": 189, "latency_s": 10.593613485999981, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 562, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-02", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un match ne peut pas commencer ou continuer si une équipe compte moins de **sept joueurs** [wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2] [ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/2", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/11", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 747, "tokens_out": 237, "latency_s": 0.9568881610000517, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 443, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-03", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une équipe peut effectuer **cinq remplacements** au maximum dans le temps réglementaire d’un match de compétition officielle, et **un sixième remplacement** est autorisé si le match se prolonge en prolongations【ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1】【wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/1】【wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/1", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/4", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/2", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 939, "tokens_out": 342, "latency_s": 1.2174446650000164, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 625, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-04", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La circonférence du ballon doit être comprise entre 68 cm et 70 cm [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1] [wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#historique/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1123, "tokens_out": 213, "latency_s": 1.4362874779999402, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 660, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-05", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le poids du ballon doit être compris entre 410 g et 450 g au début du match [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1][wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#introduction/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1112, "tokens_out": 330, "latency_s": 1.3236978760000966, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 663, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-06", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les lignes de touche doivent mesurer **au minimum 90 m** et **au maximum 120 m** [ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#dimensions", "ifab-loi-01#4-dimensions-pour-les-matches-internationaux", "ifab-loi-01#2-marquage-du-terrain/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#marquage-du-terrain/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 193, "latency_s": 0.7132546619999403, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 350, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-07", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les lignes de la surface de réparation sont tracées à 16,5 m (18 yds) des poteaux du but【ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1】【wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1", "ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/2", "ifab-loi-01#5-surface-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 841, "tokens_out": 192, "latency_s": 0.822661241999981, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 575, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-08", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque période d’un match dure 45 minutes. [ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#arret-definitif-du-match/2", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#introduction"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 727, "tokens_out": 98, "latency_s": 2.781542750999961, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 276, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-09", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La pause entre les deux périodes ne peut pas dépasser **15 minutes**【ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#mi-temps", "ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 816, "tokens_out": 134, "latency_s": 5.704380360999949, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 313, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-10", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse si le gardien de but conserve le ballon à la main pendant plus de huit secondes à l’intérieur de sa surface de réparation avant de le relâcher. [ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1] [wiki-loi-12-du-football#corner/1]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#corner/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1", "ifab-loi-12#3-corner/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#corner/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3", "wiki-corner-football#procedure"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 900, "tokens_out": 185, "latency_s": 6.924942433999945, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 464, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-11", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les adversaires doivent se placer à **au moins 9,15 m** du ballon jusqu’à ce qu’il soit en jeu. [ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#2-coup-franc-indirect/6", "ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#coup-franc-direct/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/6"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 925, "tokens_out": 115, "latency_s": 8.855908626999963, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 390, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-12", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Si le ballon pénètre directement dans le but adverse lors d’une rentrée de touche, aucun but n’est validé ; il faut accorder un coup de pied de but : « si le ballon pénètre dans le but adverse, un coup de pied de but doit être accordé »【ifab-loi-15#introduction】. Cette règle est confirmée par la description de l’exécution : « Si le ballon pénètre dans le but adverse, il est accordé un coup de pied de but »【wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-15#introduction", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/2", "ifab-loi-15#introduction", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#conditions", "ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 910, "tokens_out": 235, "latency_s": 6.940275428999939, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 557, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-13", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Non, un joueur ne peut pas être sanctionné pour hors‑jeu s’il reçoit le ballon directement sur une rentrée de touche : il n’y a pas d’infraction de hors‑jeu dans ce cas [ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction] ; la même règle apparaît dans les exceptions de la loi 11 [wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-11-du-football#infraction-de-hors-jeu/8", "ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/8"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 898, "tokens_out": 213, "latency_s": 8.094872061000046, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 399, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-14", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les seules parties du corps prises en compte sont la tête, le tronc et les jambes ; les mains et les bras (jusqu’au bas de l’aisselle) ne sont pas considérés dans le calcul du hors‑jeu【ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#position-de-hors-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/3", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1027, "tokens_out": 198, "latency_s": 8.157838413999912, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 404, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-15", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Si un joueur retarde indûment l’exécution d’un coup de pied de but en faveur de son équipe, l’arbitre siffle, signale le début d’un décompte de cinq secondes (avec un compte‑visuel). Si le coup de pied n’est pas effectué à l’issue de ces cinq secondes, un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse. Le joueur ne sera averti que s’il retarde excessivement la reprise du jeu après que le corner a été accordé [ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/4", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#coup-de-pied-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1022, "tokens_out": 289, "latency_s": 9.413895824000065, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 477, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-16", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le gardien doit rester sur la ligne de but, face au tireur et entre les poteaux, avec au moins un pied sur ou derrière la ligne (ou au même niveau si le pied ne touche pas le sol) au moment du tir. [wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1] ; [ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3]", "sources": ["wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 252, "latency_s": 9.231499188000043, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 552, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-17", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque équipe commence par exécuter cinq tirs au but. [wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1] ; [ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8]", "sources": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8"], "retrieved": ["wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/9", "wiki-tirs-au-but#handball"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1027, "tokens_out": 175, "latency_s": 7.887208511999916, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.3333333333333333, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 565, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-18", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les analyses VAR portent sur :\n\n- les décisions factuelles : emplacement d’une infraction, position d’un joueur (hors‑jeu), point de contact (main/faute), localisation de la faute (dans ou hors de la surface), situation du ballon hors du jeu, etc. [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12]  \n- les décisions subjectives : intensité d’une faute, interférence lors d’un hors‑jeu, appréciation d’une faute de main, etc. [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11]  \n\nCes décisions font partie des cinq catégories d’incidents ou de décisions que le VAR peut examiner. [ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1]", "sources": ["ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11", "ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12", "ifab-protocole-var#1-principes/3", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/16"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 991, "tokens_out": 502, "latency_s": 8.716508849000093, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": false, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 781, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-19", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Ken Aston, l'arbitre anglais, a eu l'idée d'utiliser des cartes de couleur pour les avertissements et les exclusions [wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1].", "sources": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1", "wiki-carton-jaune#football/1", "wiki-arbitre-football#tenue-de-l-arbitre/2", "wiki-carton-rouge#cricket", "wiki-carton-jaune#creation/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 872, "tokens_out": 144, "latency_s": 9.997945038000125, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 377, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-20", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "L’IFAB a intégré l’assistance vidéo à l’arbitrage dans les lois du jeu en 2018 [wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2].", "sources": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2"], "retrieved": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/1", "wiki-arbitre-football#utilisation-officielle/1", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#introduction/1", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#championnats-nationaux", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 194, "latency_s": 6.915683859999945, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 372, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-21", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Aucun des extraits fournis ne traite du coup d’envoi.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "ifab-loi-10#1-but-marque", "ifab-loi-16#introduction", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#le-but-marque", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-direct"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 852, "tokens_out": 105, "latency_s": 105.387617067, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-22", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse. [wiki-loi-8-du-football#procedure/3] [ifab-loi-08#1-coup-d-envoi/3]", "sources": ["wiki-loi-8-du-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-08#1-coup-d-envoi/3"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-8-du-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-08#1-coup-d-envoi/3", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-direct", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 758, "tokens_out": 173, "latency_s": 3.8086461509999765, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 403, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-23", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un but n’est déclaré que lorsque le ballon a entièrement franchi la ligne de but, entre les poteaux et sous la barre transversale, **à condition qu’aucune faute ou infraction aux Lois du Jeu n’ait été commise par l’équipe qui marque**【ifab-loi-10#1-but-marque】【wiki-loi-10-du-football#le-but-marque】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-10#1-but-marque", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#le-but-marque"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-10#1-but-marque", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#le-but-marque", "ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/3", "wiki-penalty-football#evolution-historique/2", "ifab-loi-03#9-but-marque-avec-personne-supplementaire-sur-le-terrain/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 941, "tokens_out": 182, "latency_s": 1.335420359000011, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 539, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-24", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Les extraits fournis ne précisent pas la durée d’une prolongation.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#mi-temps", "ifab-loi-07#4-penalty", "ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1", "wiki-remplacant-football#histoire/10"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 859, "tokens_out": 98, "latency_s": 1.5163955090000059, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-25", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une pause de rafraîchissement peut durer entre 90 secondes et 3 minutes【ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#mi-temps", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/16"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 983, "tokens_out": 123, "latency_s": 1.8377805840000008, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 383, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-26", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les attaquants doivent se placer à **au moins un mètre** du mur défensif lorsqu’il est composé de trois joueurs ou plus ; ils doivent rester à cette distance jusqu’à ce que le ballon soit en jeu. [ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4] [wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/7", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-13#3-infractions-et-sanctions/2", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 929, "tokens_out": 155, "latency_s": 2.117850718999989, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 523, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-27", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un mur défensif impose une distance aux attaquants dès qu’il comprend trois joueurs ou plus [wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/7] [ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4] [wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/7", "ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/7", "ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-13#3-infractions-et-sanctions/2", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#procedure/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 931, "tokens_out": 187, "latency_s": 1.4382469520000143, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 639, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-28", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "L’arbitre signale un coup franc indirect en levant le bras à la verticale, au‑dessus de sa tête, et le maintient dans cette position pendant l’exécution du coup franc jusqu’à ce que le ballon touche un autre joueur, sorte du jeu ou que le but ne puisse plus être marqué directement【wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-indirect/1】【ifab-loi-13#1-types-de-coups-francs/1】", "sources": ["wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-indirect/1", "ifab-loi-13#1-types-de-coups-francs/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-indirect/1", "ifab-loi-13#1-types-de-coups-francs/1", "ifab-loi-04#6-infractions-et-sanctions/2", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/7", "ifab-loi-12#2-coup-franc-indirect/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 953, "tokens_out": 270, "latency_s": 1.4219279349999852, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 527, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-29", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le capitaine doit porter un brassard (ou « armband ») fourni ou autorisé par l’organisateur, d’une seule couleur, sur lequel peut figurer le mot « capitaine », sa traduction ou la lettre « C »【ifab-loi-03#10-capitaine-de-l-equipe】【ifab-loi-04#2-equipement-obligatoire/2】.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#10-capitaine-de-l-equipe", "ifab-loi-04#2-equipement-obligatoire/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#10-capitaine-de-l-equipe", "ifab-loi-04#2-equipement-obligatoire/2", "wiki-loi-4-du-football#equipement-autorise/2", "ifab-loi-04#4-autre-equipement/1", "wiki-loi-4-du-football#equipement-autorise/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 924, "tokens_out": 225, "latency_s": 1.0506729509999957, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 528, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-30", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Les extraits fournis indiquent que deux fautes distinctes entraînent deux avertissements, mais ne précisent pas la sanction qui suit le second avertissement.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-12-du-football#avertissement/1", "ifab-loi-05#2-decisions-de-l-arbitre/3", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#avertissement/2", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/10", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/4"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 943, "tokens_out": 228, "latency_s": 6.6131727909999825, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.25, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-31", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le crachat est considéré comme un comportement agressif ; l’arbitre doit donc infliger une sanction disciplinaire, généralement un carton rouge entraînant l’exclusion du joueur du terrain [ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/29] . Le code prévoit le carton rouge pour les exclusions [wiki-loi-12-du-football#approche-disciplinaire].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/29", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#approche-disciplinaire"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-12-du-football#approche-disciplinaire", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#coup-franc-direct/2", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/3", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/29", "ifab-loi-05#3-pouvoirs-et-devoirs/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1056, "tokens_out": 486, "latency_s": 9.485083837000019, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.3333333333333333, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": false, "judge_unsupported": ["l’arbitre doit donc infliger une sanction disciplinaire, généralement un carton rouge entraînant l’exclusion du joueur du terrain"], "judge_tokens": 595, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-32", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un carton jaune est un avertissement : il signale qu’un sportif est sous le coup d’une sanction disciplinaire, sans entraîner d’expulsion immédiate [wiki-carton-jaune#introduction]. En football, il s’agit d’un avertissement délivré par l’arbitre au joueur [wiki-carton-jaune#football/1].", "sources": ["wiki-carton-jaune#introduction", "wiki-carton-jaune#football/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-carton-jaune#introduction", "wiki-carton-jaune#football/1", "wiki-carton-jaune#escalade", "wiki-carton-jaune#tennis-de-table", "wiki-carton-jaune#handball"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 719, "tokens_out": 177, "latency_s": 8.542573274000006, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.5, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": false, "judge_unsupported": ["sans entraîner d'expulsion immédiate"], "judge_tokens": 475, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-33", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une feinte illégale du tireur est considérée comme une faute plus grave ; ainsi, si le tireur et un joueur adverse commettent tous deux une infraction, le penalty ne sera pas retiré parce que la feinte illégale du tireur prime ([ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/6]). En d’autres termes, la sanction consiste à ne pas annuler le penalty, la faute du tireur étant jugée plus sérieuse que celle de l’adversaire.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/6"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/6", "wiki-penalty-football#infractions-et-sanctions", "wiki-penalty-football#avant-que-le-ballon-ne-soit-en-jeu/4", "ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 976, "tokens_out": 486, "latency_s": 8.125094406000017, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": false, "cited": true, "faithful": false, "judge_unsupported": ["si le tireur et un joueur adverse commettent tous deux une infraction, le penalty ne sera pas retiré parce que la feinte illégale du tireur prime", "la sanction consiste à ne pas annuler le penalty"], "judge_tokens": 517, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-34", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Oui, un but peut être marqué directement sur corner, mais uniquement contre l’équipe adverse — c’est‑à‑dire qu’il s’agit d’un but contre son propre camp [wiki-corner-football#introduction/2] [ifab-loi-17#introduction/1].", "sources": ["wiki-corner-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-17#introduction/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-corner-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-17#introduction/1", "wiki-corner-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-8-du-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 849, "tokens_out": 207, "latency_s": 8.071293338000004, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 503, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-35", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Oui, un but peut être marqué directement sur un coup de pied de but, mais uniquement contre l’équipe adverse ; si le ballon entre directement dans le but de l’exécutant, un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse. [ifab-loi-16#introduction]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-16#introduction"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-16#introduction", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "ifab-loi-10#1-but-marque", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#le-but-marque", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#coup-de-pied-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 894, "tokens_out": 188, "latency_s": 8.192418600999986, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 368, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-36", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Aucun des extraits fournis ne traite du cas où le ballon touche l’arbitre puis entre directement dans le but.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-13-du-football#le-coup-franc-indirect/1", "ifab-loi-14#2-infractions-et-sanctions/9", "wiki-loi-5-du-football#mesures-disciplinaires/5", "wiki-penalty-football#apres-le-penalty/2", "ifab-loi-12#5-reprise-du-jeu-apres-des-fautes-et-incorrections/1"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 889, "tokens_out": 290, "latency_s": 7.196141549000004, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-37", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Cinq catégories d’incidents : l’assistance vidéo à l’arbitrage ne peut intervenir que dans cinq types d’incidents ou de décisions [ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1].", "sources": ["ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1", "ifab-protocole-var#1-principes/1", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-05#4-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage/3", "ifab-loi-06#5-arbitres-video/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1057, "tokens_out": 186, "latency_s": 11.779260642999986, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 434, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
{"id": "doc-38", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le point de penalty est placé à **11 m** du milieu de la ligne de but【wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1】.", "sources": ["wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/2", "ifab-loi-01#2-marquage-du-terrain/3", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#d-apres-les-autres-lois-du-jeu/3", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1088, "tokens_out": 201, "latency_s": 6.3216749769999865, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 371, "trial": 0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}
